    "body": "nodev is for implementors only, nohtml is for developers only. Currently those are not actively maintained however. The developer only edtion is somewhat broken. To build the specification, the whatwg/html-build and whatwg/wattsi repositories are used. We don't have much documentation other than that I'm afraid. Please tell us if you get stuck.\r\n\r\nI'm traveling for a bit, but I'll see about documenting some of these things more clearly when back.",
